      "has_readme": true,
      "readme_length": 9602,
      "readme_excerpt": "# Radiant\n\nTask runner using Claude Agent SDK. Instead of a human guiding an AI through a task, the AI guides AI through the tasks reducing the amount of manual intervention that is required in intermediate steps.\n\n## Architecture\n\nPlanner receives a task from the user, plans the work and creates prompts for workers to complete the task, and then scrutinizes the result before user can manually intervene. Planning stage requires approval and AI can ask clarifying questions or user can intervene at this stage.\n\nRadiant processes tasks through four phases:\n\n1. **Planning** - Understand the request, explore the codebase, create implementation plan with subtasks\n2. **Implementation** - Workers execute subtasks sequentially, fixing failures if needed\n3. **Testing** - Run tests and verify the implementation works correctly\n4. **Review** - Review completed work and provide final summary\n\nThe planning stage requires user approval. AI can ask clarifying questions, or the user can provide feedback to revise the plan.\n\n### Components\n\n- **API Server** (`radiant/api.py`) - FastAPI REST API for task CRUD\n- **Planner** (`radiant/planner.py`) - Background loop that advances tasks through phases\n- ",
